na and Gore-Tex\",\"Experience the unique French Alps as you ski down the Vallée Blanche from Aiguille du Midi, taking in breathtaking views. Participate in various freeride clinics with Norrøna ambassadors and local guides, test Norrøna products, listen to inspiring presentations, enjoy local French cuisine, après-ski, and much more!\",\"Norrøna X Gore-Tex Freeride Festival - 2027\",{\"_id\":2845,\"_type\":2828,\"activity\":2846,\"cdnPath\":2847,\"detailPage\":2848,\"isFestival\":997,\"subtitle\":2849,\"teaserText\":2850,\"title\":2851},\"b5587daa-be01-456e-8e2e-0b49eb5f2e1e-en\",{\"name\":973},\"hvitserk\\u002F1_1CWHTg79anAilQZIyBuxeBzv3xTMhzE\",\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fadventure.norrona.com\\u002Fen\\u002Feastern-norway\\u002Fnorrona-trail-running-festival\",\"Our 3-day trail running adventure at Norrøna Canvas in Telemark\",\"There’s something truly special about trail running. Moving step by step along magical trails, across different types of terrain – sometimes soft earth and moss, other times roots and rocks. It’s about the natural focus that emerges. The flow. The presence. That unique feeling of almost floating through the landscape. This is exactly what we are chasing during this festival. And we can guarantee that you’ll experience it.\",\"Norrøna Trail Running Festival\",{\"_id\":2853,\"_type\":2828,\"activity\":28,\"cdnPath\":2854,\"detailPage\":2855,\"isFestival\":997,\"subtitle\":2856,\"teaserText\":2857,\"title\":2858},\"ca6c677c-db8d-4b6f-bbf0-98295197ca55-en\",\"hvitserk\\u002F1MzgTyQMi4j7LbvPioMgHGQM3GH8-aJ6G\",\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fadventure.norrona.com\\u002Fen\\u002Feastern-norway\\u002Fnorrona-mountain-bike-festival-canvas\",\"Our 3-day mountain biking adventure at Norrøna Canvas in Telemark\",\"Whether you're an experienced rider or just starting your biking journey, this is your opportunity to explore world-class trails, try out the latest gear, and gain valuable insights from experts – all in one place.\",\"Norrøna x Specialized Mountain Bike Festival\",[2860,2903,2939,2990,3027,3058],{\"_id\":2861,\"_type\":1746,\"activity\":2862,\"activityId\":1096,\"activityTags\":2863,\"city\":2865,\"collectionTags\":2866,\"contentCategory\":2869,\"countryCode\":1465,\"end\":2871,\"eventType\":1014,\"featuredMedia\":2872,\"id\":2882,\"isActive\":997,\"isApproximateDate\":29,\"isHighlighted\":28,\"isRelated\":997,\"leadText\":2883,\"location\":28,\"locationCity\":28,\"locationCountry\":28,\"series\":28,\"slug\":2898,\"start\":2900,\"status\":1537,\"storeExternalId\":2901,\"storeName\":2902,\"subTitle\":2902,\"title\":2428},\"0b826292-b493-5d9b-b20f-9f301fc77264\",{\"name\":359,\"order\":1919},[2864],{\"label\":359,\"value\":1096},\"Stavanger\",[2867,2868],{\"label\":367,\"value\":367},{\"label\":388,\"value\":388},{\"_id\":1751,\"_type\":1752,\"title\":1753,\"value\":2870},{\"_type\":1755,\"current\":1001},\"2026-11-05T21:30:00\",{\"mediaItems\":2873},[2874],{\"_key\":1931,\"_type\":1527,\"altText\":1932,\"asset\":28,\"center\":2875,\"description\":28,\"height\":1949,\"pathCdn\":1950,\"preferredCenter\":28,\"type\":28,\"width\":1951},[2876,2878,2880],{\"t\":2877},[1936,1323,1937,1537,1938,1832],{\"t\":2879},[1941,1335,1537,1942,1540,1943],{\"t\":2881},[1946,1546,1947,1537,1948,1832],\"0e60afc3-2f99-41d0-82a8-44ad49012237\",[2884],{\"_key\":2885,\"_type\":1795,\"children\":2886,\"markDefs\":2897,\"style\":1804},\"b6c2ff6ed0f0\",[2887,2891,2894],{\"_key\":2888,\"_type\":1799,\"marks\":2889,\"text\":2890},\"bc7ae40e7ec1\",[],\"Join us for a post-screening hangout at the Norrøna Stavanger store, celebrating TGR’s 31st annual ski film, \",{\"_key\":2892,\"_type\":1799,\"marks\":2893,\"text\":2194},\"c7090fb2dce5\",[2193],{\"_key\":2895,\"_type\":1799,\"marks\":2896,\"text\":2421},\"f0bb84483777\",[],[],{\"_type\":1755,\"current\":2899},\"tgr-film-tour-post-show-event-stavanger-2026-11-05\",\"2026-11-05T20:30:00\",\"NORRONA_STAVANGER\",\"Norrøna Concept Store Stavanger\",{\"_id\":2904,\"_type\":1746,\"activity\":2905,\"act