<div class=\"drawer-inner\"><!--[--><div class=\"person-featured-list\"><!--[--><div class=\"person-featured-card font-responsive-body\"><hr class=\"person-featured-rule\"><section class=\"person-teaser font-responsive-body m-b-18 -linkable person-featured-summary\"><a href=\"/gb/en/ambassador/robert-caspersen\" class=\"-black\"><div class=\"d-flex flex-gap\"><div class=\"person-teaser-avatar m-b-12\"><div class=\"media-wrapper\" style=\"--media-ratio-sm:1;\"><figure><picture><!--[--><!--]--><img loading=\"lazy\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"base-image base-image-lazy\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/norrona/image/upload/x_1918,y_1917,w_3835,h_3835,c_crop,g_xy_center/b_rgb:fcfcfc/c_pad,f_auto,d_imgmissing.jpg,fl_progressive.lossy,q_auto,w_3835,h_3835/Auto%2F1604-25-trollveggen%20Gore-Tex%20Pro%20light%20Jacket-FW2526%40ChrisHolter_DSC3095.jpg\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/norrona/image/upload/x_1918,y_1917,w_3835,h_3835,c_crop,g_xy_center/b_rgb:fcfcfc/c_pad,f_auto,d_imgmissing.jpg,fl_progressive.lossy,q_auto,w_220,h_220/Auto%2F1604-25-trollveggen%20Gore-Tex%20Pro%20light%20Jacket-FW2526%40ChrisHolter_DSC3095.jpg 220w,https://res.cloudinary.com/norrona/image/upload/x_1918,y_1917,w_3835,h_3835,c_crop,g_xy_center/b_rgb:fcfcfc/c_pad,f_auto,d_imgmissing.jpg,fl_progressive.lossy,q_auto,w_275,h_275/Auto%2F1604-25-trollveggen%20Gore-Tex%20Pro%20light%20Jacket-FW2526%40ChrisHolter_DSC3095.jpg 275w\" sizes=\"80px\" width=\"3835\" height=\"3835\" alt=\"A man wearing a Norrøna jacket and helmet ice climbing a snowy wall. He holds two ice axes. \n\" style=\"aspect-ratio:var(--media-ratio, 1);\" decoding=\"async\"></picture><!----></figure></div></div><div><p class=\"font-responsive-small -small-caps\">Featured Host</p><p class=\"person-teaser-name font-responsive-body\">Robert Caspersen</p><p class=\"font-responsive-small m-t-6\">Mountaineer</p></div></div></a><!----><!----></section><section class=\"person-teaser font-responsive-body m-b-18 -large -linkable -details-only person-featured-body\"><!----><div class=\"person-teaser-bio font-responsive-small\"><p class=\"-clamped\">Robert Caspersen is a renowned mountaineer, professional guide, and adventurer. He is famous for pioneering new routes in some of the most remote regions on Earth, and he&#39;s considered one of Norway&#39;s most versatile climbers, with a career spanning over three decades in sport climbing, traditional mountaineering, and high-altitude expeditions.</p></div><div class=\"person-teaser-details font-responsive-small\"><!----><!--[--><!----><div class=\"person-teaser-footer d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center\"><!----><a href=\"/gb/en/ambassador/robert-caspersen\" class=\"-underline -clickable\">Show full profile</a></div><!--]--></div></section></div><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></div></section></section><!--]--></section><section class=\"g-12 g-md-7-6\"><section class=\"m-b-36\" data-sanity=\"id=591be25e-6829-52f8-b0c4-be5853a275f2;type=eventPage;path=leadText:en.value;base=%2F\"><div class=\"article-lead-text g-12 font-responsive-large -strong\"><!--[--><p>The countdown is nearly over for the opening of Norrøna London store!</p><!--]--></div></section><section class=\"content-area\"><div data-sanity=\"id=591be25e-6829-52f8-b0c4-be5853a275f2;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value;base=%2F\"><section class=\"content-area\" style=\"color:inherit;background-color:transparent;\"><div class=\"content-area-portable-text\"><!--[--><section class=\"\" data-sanity=\"id=591be25e-6829-52f8-b0c4-be5853a275f2;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value:d3c2ae3a333c;base=%2F\"><p class=\"g-12 m-b-18\"><strong>About</strong></p></section><section class=\"\" data-sanity=\"id=591be25e-6829-52f8-b0c4-be5853a275f2;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value:d2c2ec757b00;base=%2F\"><p class=\"g-12 m-b-18\">We&#39;re delighted to have found the perfect space to set up a shop in London, and this is your chance join as our guest for this exclusive celebration.</p></section><section class=\"\" data-sanity=\"id=591be25e-6829-52f8-b0c4-be5853a275f2;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value:e5159fe5c0d4;base=%2F\"><p class=\"g-12 m-b-18\"><strong>Highlights:</strong></p></section><section class=\"\" data-sanity=\"id=591be25e-6829-52f8-b0c4-be5853a275f2;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value:fef7bc154de4-parent;base=%2F\"><ul class=\"g-12 m-b-18 custom-ul\"><li class=\"list-bullet\" data-sanity=\"id=591be25e-6829-52f8-b0c4-be5853a275f2;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value:fef7bc154de4;base=%2F\">A conversation with <strong>Norrøna owner and CEO Jørgen Jørgensen</strong>, alongside Outdoor Leader <strong>Will Renwick</strong>.</li><li class=\"list-bullet\" data-sanity=\"id=591be25e-6829-52f8-b0c4-be5853a275f2;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value:8bf593110d3b;base=%2F\">Meet Norrøna ambassador and climbing legend <strong>Robert Caspersen</strong>, plus local London Norrøna athletes</li><li class=\"list-bullet\" data-sanity=\"id=591be25e-6829-52f8-b0c4-be5853a275f2;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value:2d8bf5d116da;base=%2F\">Drinks curated by world-renowned Norwegian cocktail bar HIMKOK</li><li class=\"list-bullet\" data-sanity=\"id=591be25e-6829-52f8-b0c4-be5853a275f2;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value:5668036f3578;base=%2F\">Canapés</li><li class=\"list-bullet\" data-sanity=\"id=591be25e-6829-52f8-b0c4-be5853a275f2;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value:6ce5da4d53a0;base=%2F\">DJ set by Jojo Deevoy</li><li class=\"list-bullet\" data-sanity=\"id=591be25e-6829-52f8-b0c4-be5853a275f2;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value:f6978c4e5b32;base=%2F\">Interactive workshop with <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/nots___/\">Nots</a></li><li class=\"list-bullet\" data-sanity=\"id=591be25e-6829-52f8-b0c4-be5853a275f2;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value:70310b164b0f;base=%2F\">Prize raffle</li></ul></section><section class=\"\" data-sanity=\"id=591be25e-6829-52f8-b0c4-be5853a275f2;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value:1eaf8219571f;base=%2F\"><p class=\"g-12 m-b-18\"><strong>What is your all time favorite Norrøna product and why?</strong><br>You can answer in one sentence or with a novel. As long as the love for your favorite product is loud and clear.</p></section><section class=\"\" data-sanity=\"id=591be25e-6829-52f8-b0c4-be5853a275f2;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value:81d589b981d1;base=%2F\"><p class=\"g-12 m-b-18\"><strong>Opening hours:</strong></p></section><section class=\"\" data-sanity=\"id=591be25e-6829-52f8-b0c4-be5853a275f2;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value:6809d99405f3-parent;base=%2F\"><ul class=\"g-12 m-b-18 custom-ul\"><li class=\"list-bullet\" data-sanity=\"id=591be25e-6829-52f8-b0c4-be5853a275f2;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value:6809d99405f3;base=%2F\">When: Thursday, November 19th</li><li class=\"list-bullet\" data-sanity=\"id=591be25e-6829-52f8-b0c4-be5853a275f2;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value:9f76eba2ef62;base=%2F\">Doors opening: 18:00</li><li class=\"list-bullet\" data-sanity=\"id=591be25e-6829-52f8-b0c4-be5853a275f2;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value:b46e2aab54cc;base=%2F\">Where: 15 Regent Street, London</li></ul></section><section class=\"\" data-sanity=\"id=591be25e-6829-52f8-b0c4-be5853a275f2;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value:3262f9a9be13;base=%2F\"><p class=\"g-12 m-b-18\">We would be thrilled to celebrate this global event with you!</p></section><section class=\"\" data-sanity=\"id=591be25e-6829-52f8-b0c4-be5853a275f2;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value:cbe8de343589;base=%2F\"><p class=\"g-12 m-b-18\"><em>Winners will be contacted on the 12th of November by email. </em></p></section><section class=\"portable-text-image -carousel\" style=\"\" color=\"inherit\" data-sanity=\"id=591be25e-6829-52f8-b0c4-be5853a275f2;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value:ede0c50c0661;base=%2F\"><div class=\"m-b-18 m-b-md-36 -carousel\"><div class=\"\"><figure class=\"portable-text-image-carousel\"><div clas