er, professional guide, and adventurer. He is famous for pioneering new routes in some of the most remote regions on Earth, and he's considered one of Norway's most versatile climbers, with a career spanning over three decades in sport climbing, traditional mountaineering, and high-altitude expeditions.\",\"Mountaineer\",\"Robert Caspersen\",[3299,3307,3315,3323,3347,3362,3370,3378,3386,3402,3410,3422,3430,3438,3445,3453,3461,3470,3518,3545],{\"_key\":3300,\"_type\":1615,\"children\":3301,\"markDefs\":3306,\"style\":1623},\"d3c2ae3a333c\",[3302],{\"_key\":3303,\"_type\":1619,\"marks\":3304,\"text\":1404},\"d4ff63c9402a\",[3305],\"strong\",[],{\"_key\":3308,\"_type\":1615,\"children\":3309,\"markDefs\":3314,\"style\":1623},\"d2c2ec757b00\",[3310],{\"_key\":3311,\"_type\":1619,\"marks\":3312,\"text\":3313},\"4e57d293072b\",[],\"We're delighted to have found the perfect space to set up a shop in London, and this is your chance join as our guest for this exclusive celebration.\",[],{\"_key\":3316,\"_type\":1615,\"children\":3317,\"markDefs\":3322,\"style\":1623},\"e5159fe5c0d4\",[3318],{\"_key\":3319,\"_type\":1619,\"marks\":3320,\"text\":3321},\"ffcf750dc6a5\",[3305],\"Highlights:\",[],{\"_key\":3324,\"_type\":1615,\"children\":3325,\"level\":215,\"listItem\":2882,\"markDefs\":3346,\"style\":1623},\"fef7bc154de4\",[3326,3330,3334,3338,3342],{\"_key\":3327,\"_type\":1619,\"marks\":3328,\"text\":3329},\"8152243b12a5\",[],\"A conversation with \",{\"_key\":3331,\"_type\":1619,\"marks\":3332,\"text\":3333},\"153063932fec\",[3305],\"Norrøna owner and CEO Jørgen Jørgensen\",{\"_key\":3335,\"_type\":1619,\"marks\":3336,\"text\":3337},\"99dcf3c8762b\",[],\", alongside Outdoor Leader \",{\"_key\":3339,\"_type\":1619,\"marks\":3340,\"text\":3341},\"03cfded02779\",[3305],\"Will Renwick\",{\"_key\":3343,\"_type\":1619,\"marks\":3344,\"text\":3345},\"c0aef275c1aa\",[],\".\",[],{\"_key\":3348,\"_type\":1615,\"children\":3349,\"level\":215,\"listItem\":2882,\"markDefs\":3361,\"style\