id=ChIJHUqC1ygFdkgRw-goNXWgCUk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"event-location-map-route font-responsive-small\">Calculate route</a><a href=\"/gb/en/store/norrona-flagship-store-london\" class=\"event-location-store-link font-responsive-small\">Norrøna Flagship Store London</a><div class=\"event-location-store-wrap\"><hr class=\"event-location-store-rule\"><a href=\"/gb/en/store/norrona-flagship-store-london\" class=\"event-location-store -black\"><span class=\"event-location-store-image\"><div class=\"media-wrapper\" style=\"--media-ratio-sm:1;\"><figure><picture><!--[--><!--]--><img loading=\"lazy\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"base-image base-image-lazy\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/norrona/image/upload/x_1510,y_1915,w_3021,h_3021,c_crop,g_xy_center/b_rgb:fcfcfc/c_pad,f_auto,d_imgmissing.jpg,fl_progressive.lossy,q_auto,w_3021,h_3021/Auto%2FFlagship_london-norrona-storefront-1-no-people_2-edited.jpg\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/norrona/image/upload/x_1510,y_1915,w_3021,h_3021,c_crop,g_xy_center/b_rgb:fcfcfc/c_pad,f_auto,d_imgmissing.jpg,fl_progressive.lossy,q_auto,w_220,h_220/Auto%2FFlagship_london-norrona-storefront-1-no-people_2-edited.jpg 220w,https://res.cloudinary.com/norrona/image/upload/x_1510,y_1915,w_3021,h_3021,c_crop,g_xy_center/b_rgb:fcfcfc/c_pad,f_auto,d_imgmissing.jpg,fl_progressive.lossy,q_auto,w_275,h_275/Auto%2FFlagship_london-norrona-storefront-1-no-people_2-edited.jpg 275w\" sizes=\"80px\" width=\"3021\" height=\"3021\" alt=\"Norrøna storefront with a poster of a man in a Norrøna jacket next to an opening soon sign.\" style=\"aspect-ratio:var(--media-ratio, 1);\" decoding=\"async\"></picture><!----></figure></div></span><span><span class=\"d-block font-responsive-small -small-caps\">Event location</span><span class=\"d-block font-responsive-body\">Norrøna Flagship Store London</span><span class=\"d-block font-responsive-small m-t-6\">15th Regent Street, SW1Y 4LR, London</span></span></a></div></div><!--]--></div></div></section><!----><section class=\"person-featured m-t-md-18\" data-sanity=\"id=e3dbd002-8f61-525f-a433-242787ad7459;type=eventPage;path=persons;base=%2F\"><section class=\"drawer -separator-mobile -full-width person-featured-collapse\"><hr><div class=\"drawer-header justify-content-between align-items-center -clickable\"><!--[--><div class=\"person-byline\"><span class=\"person-byline-avatars\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><!--[--><span class=\"person-byline-avatar\"><div class=\"media-wrapper\" style=\"--media-ratio-sm:1;\"><figure><picture><!--[--><!--]--><img loading=\"lazy\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"base-image base-image-lazy\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/norrona/image/upload/x_3739,y_2877,w_5753,h_5753,c_crop,g_xy_center/b_rgb:fcfcfc/c_pad,f_auto,d_imgmissing.jpg,fl_progressive.lossy,q_auto,w_5000,h_5000/Auto%2FFW2526-femund-norrona_femunden_winter_sjut_sverrehjornevik-4912.jpg\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/norrona/image/upload/x_3739,y_2877,w_5753,h_5753,c_crop,g_xy_center/b_rgb:fcfcfc/c_pad,f_auto,d_imgmissing.jpg,fl_progressive.lossy,q_auto,w_220,h_220/Auto%2FFW2526-femund-norrona_femunden_winter_sjut_sverrehjornevik-4912.jpg 220w\" sizes=\"32px\" width=\"5753\" height=\"5753\" alt=\"A woman wearing a Norrøna jacket and sunglasses, adjusts her glasses, looking at the camera with a mountain range blurred in the background.\" style=\"aspect-ratio:var(--media-ratio, 1);\" decoding=\"async\"></picture><!----></figure></div></span><span class=\"person-byline-avatar\"><div class=\"media-wrapper\" style=\"--media-ratio-sm:1;\"><figure><picture><!--[--><!--]--><img loading=\"lazy\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"base-image base-image-lazy\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/norrona/image/upload/x_3648,y_2877,w_5754,h_5754,c_crop,g_xy_center/b_rgb:fcfcfc/c_pad,f_auto,d_imgmissing.jpg,fl_progressive.lossy,q_auto,w_5000,h_5000/Auto%2FFW2526-femund-norrona_femunden_winter_sjut_sverrehjornevik-4086.jpg\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/norrona/image/upload/x_3648,y_2877,w_5754,h_5754,c_crop,g_xy_center/b_rgb:fcfcfc/c_pad,f_auto,d_imgmissing.jpg,fl_progressive.lossy,q_auto,w_220,h_220/Auto%2FFW2526-femund-norrona_femunden_winter_sjut_sverrehjornevik-4086.jpg 220w\" sizes=\"32px\" width=\"5754\" height=\"5754\" alt=\"A man wearing a Norrøna jacket and sunglasses smiles while standing in a snowy mountain landscape. \n\" style=\"aspect-ratio:var(--media-ratio, 1);\" decoding=\"async\"></picture><!----></figure></div></span><!--]--></span><span class=\"person-byline-text font-responsive-small\"><span class=\"d-block -small-caps\">Featured Hosts</span><span class=\"person-byline-names\">Fien Van Zwieten, Emil Leenderts</span><!----></span></div><!--]--><button class=\"stripped-btn -black chevron-wrapper\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Fien Van Zwieten, Emil Leenderts\"><svg version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 16\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-chevron\" style=\"width:16px;min-width:16px;height:16px;\"><g fill=\"none\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"><polygon points=\"0 0 16 0 16 16 0 16\"></polygon><polygon points=\"8 10.171 14.586 3.5863 16 5.0007 8 13 -5.8298e-5 5.0007 1.4141 3.5863\" fill=\"#1D1D1D\"></polygon></g></svg></button></div><div class=\"drawer-content\"><div class=\"drawer-inner\"><!--[--><div class=\"person-featured-list\"><!--[--><div class=\"person-featured-card font-responsive-body\"><hr class=\"person-featured-rule\"><section class=\"person-teaser font-responsive-body m-b-18 -linkable person-featured-summary\"><a href=\"/gb/en/ambassador/fien-van-zwieten\" class=\"-black\"><div class=\"d-flex flex-gap\"><div class=\"person-teaser-avatar m-b-12\"><div class=\"media-wrapper\" style=\"--media-ratio-sm:1;\"><figure><picture><!--[--><!--]--><img loading=\"lazy\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"base-image base-image-lazy\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/norrona/image/upload/x_3739,y_2877,w_5753,h_5753,c_crop,g_xy_center/b_rgb:fcfcfc/c_pad,f_auto,d_imgmissing.jpg,fl_progressive.lossy,q_auto,w_5000,h_5000/Auto%2FFW2526-femund-norrona_femunden_winter_sjut_sverrehjornevik-4912.jpg\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/norrona/image/upload/x_3739,y_2877,w_5753,h_5753,c_crop,g_xy_center/b_rgb:fcfcfc/c_pad,f_auto,d_imgmissing.jpg,fl_progressive.lossy,q_auto,w_220,h_220/Auto%2FFW2526-femund-norrona_femunden_winter_sjut_sverrehjornevik-4912.jpg 220w,https://res.cloudinary.com/norrona/image/upload/x_3739,y_2877,w_5753,h_5753,c_crop,g_xy_center/b_rgb:fcfcfc/c_pad,f_auto,d_imgmissing.jpg,fl_progressive.lossy,q_auto,w_275,h_275/Auto%2FFW2526-femund-norrona_femunden_winter_sjut_sverrehjornevik-4912.jpg 275w\" sizes=\"80px\" width=\"5753\" height=\"5753\" alt=\"A woman wearing a Norrøna jacket and sunglasses, adjusts her glasses, looking at the camera with a mountain range blurred in the background.\" style=\"aspect-ratio:var(--media-ratio, 1);\" decoding=\"async\"></picture><!----></figure></div></div><div><p class=\"font-responsive-small -small-caps\">Featured Host</p><p class=\"person-teaser-name font-responsive-body\">Fien Van Zwieten</p><p class=\"font-responsive-small m-t-6\">Skier</p></div></div></a><!----><!----></section><section class=\"person-teaser font-responsive-body m-b-18 -large -linkable -details-only person-featured-body\"><!----><div class=\"person-teaser-bio font-responsive-small\"><p class=\"-clamped\">Fien van Zwieten is a freeride skier with Dutch roots who grew up in the Sunnmøre region on Norway’s west coast. She started skiing at three years old and later moved from alpine racing into freeride and backcountry skiing.</p></div><div class=\"person-teaser-details font-responsive-small\"><!----><!--[--><!----><div class=\"person-teaser-footer d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center\"><!----><a href=\"/gb/en/ambassador/fien-van-zwieten\" class=\"-underline -clickable\">Show full profile</a></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class=\"person-featured-card font-responsive-body\"><hr class=\"person-featured-rule\"><section class=\"person-teaser font-responsive-body m-b-18 -linkable person-featured-summary\"><a href=\"/gb/en/ambassador/emil-leenderts\" class=\"-black\"><div class=\"d-flex flex-gap\"><div class=\"person-teaser-avatar m-b-12\"><div class=\"media-wrapper\" style=\"--media-ratio-sm:1;\"><figure><picture><!--[--><!--]--><img loading=\"lazy\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"base-image base-image-lazy\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/norrona/image/upload/x_3648,y_2877,w_5754,h_5754,c_crop,g_xy_center/b_rgb:fcfcfc/c_pad,f_auto,d_imgmissing.jpg,fl_progressive.lossy,q_auto,w_5000,h_5000/Auto%2FFW2526-femund-norrona_femunden_winter_sjut_sverrehjornevik-4086.jpg\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/norrona/image/upload/x_3648,y_2877,w_5754,h_5754,c_crop,g_xy_center/b_rgb:fcfcfc/c_pad,f_auto,d_imgmissing.jpg,fl_progressive.lossy,q_auto,w_220,h_220/Auto%2FFW2526-femund-norrona_femunden_winter_sjut_sverrehjornevik-4086.jpg 220w,https://res.cloudinary.com/norrona/image/upload/x_3648,y_2877,w_5754,h_5754,c_crop,g_xy_center/b_rgb:fcfcfc/c_pad,f_auto,d_imgmissing.jpg,fl_progressive.lossy,q_auto,w_275,h_275/Auto%2FFW2526-femund-norrona_femunden_winter_sjut_sverrehjornevik-4086.jpg 275w\" sizes=\"80px\" width=\"5754\" height=\"5754\" alt=\"A man wearing a Norrøna jacket and sunglasses smiles while standing in a snowy mountain landscape. \n\" style=\"aspect-ratio:var(--media-ratio, 1);\" decoding=\"async\"></picture><!----></figure></div></div><div><p class=\"font-responsive-small -small-caps\">Featured Host</p><p class=\"person-teaser-name font-responsive-body\">Emil Leenderts</p><p class=\"font-responsive-small m-t-6\">Snowboarder</p></div></div></a><!----><!----></section><section class=\"person-teaser font-responsive-body m-b-18 -large -linkable -details-only person-featured-body\"><!----><div class=\"person-teaser-bio font-responsive-small\"><p class=\"-clamped\">Emil Leenderts describes himself as a semi‑professional snowboarder, surfer and filmmaker and spends most of his time in the mountains and in the ocean.</p></div><div class=\"person-teaser-details font-responsive-small\"><!----><!--[--><!----><div class=\"person-teaser-footer d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center\"><!----><a href=\"/gb/en/ambassador/emil-leenderts\" class=\"-underline -clickable\">Show full profile</a></div><!--]--></div></section></div><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></div></section></section><!--]--></section><section class=\"g-12 g-md-7-6\"><section class=\"m-b-36\" data-sanity=\"id=e3dbd002-8f61-525f-a433-242787ad7459;type=eventPage;path=leadText:en.value;base=%2F\"><div class=\"article-lead-text g-12 font-responsive-large -strong\"><!--[--><p>Join us at the Norrøna London store as we launch the 2026/27 winter season with three remarkable films.</p><!--]--></div></section><section class=\"content-area\"><div data-sanity=\"id=e3dbd002-8f61-525f-a433-242787ad7459;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value;base=%2F\"><section class=\"content-area\" style=\"color:inherit;background-color:transparent;\"><div class=\"content-area-portable-text\"><!--[--><section class=\"\" data-sanity=\"id=e3dbd002-8f61-525f-a433-242787ad7459;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value:07227cb52784;base=%2F\"><p class=\"g-12 m-b-18\">Together, we&#39;ll premiere three remarkable Norwegian ski films that remind us why we keep chasing winter, year after year. An evening dedicated to deep powder, towering mountains, unforgettable stories, and the people who live for winter.</p></section><section class=\"m-b-6\" data-sanity=\"id=e3dbd002-8f61-525f-a433-242787ad7459;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value:12896221eead;base=%2F\"><h4 class=\"g-12 font-responsive-large\"><strong>“Ferryland”</strong></h4></section><section class=\"\" data-sanity=\"id=e3dbd002-8f61-525f-a433-242787ad7459;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value:08348f27a967;base=%2F\"><p class=\"g-12 m-b-18\">Hidden in the middle of Norway&#39;s spectacular Hjørundfjord lies a tiny village with no road in or out – only mountains rising straight from the sea.</p></section><section class=\"\" data-sanity=\"id=e3dbd002-8f61-525f-a433-242787ad7459;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value:254742f08c9d;base=%2F\"><p class=\"g-12 m-b-18\">Norrøna ambassador and professional snowboarder <strong>Emil Leenderts</strong> gathers a crew of close friends and heads into this extraordinary landscape in search of steep lines, deep snow, and the kind of skiing and snowboarding most people only dream about.</p></section><section class=\"\" data-sanity=\"id=e3dbd002-8f61-525f-a433-242787ad7459;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value:f83d0ea3e39b;base=%2F\"><p class=\"g-12 m-b-18\">This is a celebration of friendship, freedom, and the endless possibilities waiting beyond the map. </p></section><section class=\"\" data-sanity=\"id=e3dbd002-8f61-525f-a433-242787ad7459;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value:d36b44c3f4dd;base=%2F\"><p class=\"g-12 m-b-18\">The film was also <strong>awarded</strong> <strong>Best Cinematography at iF3.</strong></p></section><section class=\"m-b-6\" data-sanity=\"id=e3dbd002-8f61-525f-a433-242787ad7459;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value:c038a092d2d8;base=%2F\"><h4 class=\"g-12 font-responsive-large\"><strong>“A DERAILED HUMAN DREAM”</strong></h4></section><section class=\"\" data-sanity=\"id=e3dbd002-8f61-525f-a433-242787ad7459;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value:061fb4b6ffa7;base=%2F\"><p class=\"g-12 m-b-18\">Professional skier and Norrøna ambassador <strong>Fien van Zwieten</strong> has become one of the most original voices in modern freeskiing.</p></section><section class=\"\" data-sanity=\"id=e3dbd002-8f61-525f-a433-242787ad7459;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value:bdb9bb67c14e;base=%2F\"><p class=\"g-12 m-b-18\">In this deeply personal film, she combines breathtaking skiing with an honest exploration of what it&#39;s like to live – and ski – with ADHD.</p></section><section class=\"\" data-sanity=\"id=e3dbd002-8f61-525f-a433-242787ad7459;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value:1e938ab25c13;base=%2F\"><p class=\"g-12 m-b-18\">Raw, emotional, creative, and beautifully filmed, this is far more than a ski movie. It&#39;s a story about seeing the world differently – and turning that difference into your greatest strength.</p></section><section class=\"m-b-6\" data-sanity=\"id=e3dbd002-8f61-525f-a433-242787ad7459;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value:7beba3aeb1e3;base=%2F\"><h4 class=\"g-12 font-responsive-large\"><strong>“The Maiden Voyage”</strong></h4></section><section class=\"\" data-sanity=\"id=e3dbd002-8f61-525f-a433-242787ad7459;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value:94673c60a0c3;base=%2F\"><p class=\"g-12 m-b-18\">What happens when you combine a beautifully restored expedition sailing yacht with a team of elite skiers and snowboarders, the Arctic Ocean, and a collection of remote Norwegian islands few people have ever explored in winter?</p></section><section class=\"\" data-sanity=\"id=e3dbd002-8f61-525f-a433-242787ad7459;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value:b59e1ed47c59;base=%2F\"><p class=\"g-12 m-b-18\">You get <strong>VARG</strong>.</p></section><section class=\"\" data-sanity=\"id=e3dbd002-8f61-525f-a433-242787ad7459;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value:c018f203ed46;base=%2F\"><p class=\"g-12 m-b-18\">In February 2026, Norrøna&#39;s expedition yacht carried its first winter expedition into the far north, unlocking spectacular terrain that simply can&#39;t be reached any other way.</p></section><section class=\"\" data-sanity=\"id=e3dbd002-8f61-525f-a433-242787ad7459;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value:418ac4ae6f18;base=%2F\"><p class=\"g-12 m-b-18\"><strong>This adventure isn&#39;t just something you can watch. It&#39;s something you can experience yourself.</strong></p></section><section class=\"\" data-sanity=\"id=e3dbd002-8f61-525f-a433-242787ad7459;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value:904d6f2c7f18;base=%2F\"><p class=\"g-12 m-b-18\">Throughout the evening you&#39;ll also enjoy:</p></section><section class=\"\" data-sanity=\"id=e3dbd002-8f61-525f-a433-242787ad7459;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value:64607dddd10d-parent;base=%2F\"><ul class=\"g-12 m-b-18 custom-ul\"><li class=\"list-bullet\" data-sanity=\"id=e3dbd002-8f61-525f-a433-242787ad7459;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value:64607dddd10d;base=%2F\"><strong>Live conversations with the filmmakers and athletes, hosted by <em>Norrøna Magazine</em> editor Eivind Eidslott.</strong></li><li class=\"list-bullet\" data-sanity=\"id=e3dbd002-8f61-525f-a433-242787ad7459;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value:b0e2dc74895c;base=%2F\">Drinks, snacks, and the chance to meet fellow skiers, snowboarders, filmmakers, ambassadors, and mountain people from across the Norrøna community.</li></ul></section><section class=\"\" data-sanity=\"id=e3dbd002-8f61-525f-a433-242787ad7459;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value:51411034fe14;base=%2F\"><p class=\"g-12 m-b-18\">Welcome to an unforgettable night – and to what we hope will be the greatest winter yet. We can&#39;t wait to celebrate with you!</p></section><section class=\"\" data-sanity=\"id=e3dbd002-8f61-525f-a433-242787ad7459;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value:3248e39be850;base=%2F\"><p class=\"g-12 m-b-18\"><strong>Practical info</strong></p></section><section class=\"\" data-sanity=\"id=e3dbd002-8f61-525f-a433-242787ad7459;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value:b82ad4a7e765-parent;base=%2F\"><ul class=\"g-12 m-b-18 custom-ul\"><li class=\"list-bullet\" data-sanity=\"id=e3dbd002-8f61-525f-a433-242787ad7459;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value:b82ad4a7e765;base=%2F\">When: 2nd of December at 19:30</li><li class=\"list-bullet\" data-sanity=\"id=e3dbd002-8f61-525f-a433-242787ad7459;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value:c779ad594e7a;base=%2F\">Where: Norrøna London, 15 Regent Street, London</li></ul></section><section class=\"\" data-sanity=\"id=e3dbd002-8f61-525f-a433-242787ad7459;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value:150f9943a7b1;base=%2F\"><p class=\"g-12 m-b-18\">Some snacks and drinks will be served.</p></section><section class=\"portable-text-image -textWidth\" style=\"\" color=\"inherit\" data-sanity=\"id=e3dbd002-8f61-525f-a433-242787ad7459;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value:0a94379fa5be;base=%2F\"><div class=\"m-b-18 m-b-md-36 -textWidth\"><div class=\"\"><figure class=\"\"><div class=\"portable-text-image-media\"><div class=\"media-wrapper\" style=\"--media-ratio-sm:1.25;\"><figure><picture><!--[--><!--]--><img loading=\"lazy\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"base-image base-image-lazy\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/norrona/image/upload/f_auto,d_imgmissing.jpg,fl_progressive.lossy,q_auto,b_rgb:fcfcfc,w_4930,h_3944/Auto%2FFilm-tour-Munich-adhd.jpg\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/norrona/image/upload/f_auto,d_imgmissing.jpg,fl_progressive.lossy,q_auto,b_rgb:fcfcfc,w_220,h_176/Auto%2FFilm-tour-Munich-adhd.jpg 220w,https://res.cloudinary.com/norrona/image/upload/f_auto,d_imgmissing.jpg,fl_progressive.lossy,q_auto,b_rgb:fcfcfc,w_275,h_220/Auto%2FFilm-tour-Munich-adhd.jpg 275w,https://res.cloudinary.com/norrona/image/upload/f_auto,d_imgmissing.jpg,fl_progressive.lossy,q_auto,b_rgb:fcfcfc,w_410,h_328/Auto%2FFilm-tour-Munich-adhd.jpg 410w,https://res.cloudinary.com/norrona/image/upload/f_auto,d_imgmissing.jpg,fl_progressive.lossy,q_auto,b_rgb:fcfcfc,w_600,h_480/Auto%2FFilm-tour-Munich-adhd.jpg 600w,https://res.cloudinary.com/norrona/image/upload/f_auto,d_imgmissing.jpg,fl_progressive.lossy,q_auto,b_rgb:fcfcfc,w_721,h_577/Auto%2FFilm-tour-Munich-adhd.jpg 721w,https://res.cloudinary.com/norrona/image/upload/f_auto,d_imgmissing.jpg,fl_progressive.lossy,q_auto,b_rgb:fcfcfc,w_828,h_662/Auto%2FFilm-tour-Munich-adhd.jpg 828w,https://res.cloudinary.com/norrona/image/upload/f_auto,d_imgmissing.jpg,fl_progressive.lossy,q_auto,b_rgb:fcfcfc,w_992,h_794/Auto%2FFilm-tour-Munich-adhd.jpg 992w,https://res.cloudinary.com/norrona/image/upload/f_auto,d_imgmissing.jpg,fl_progressive.lossy,q_auto,b_rgb:fcfcfc,w_1200,h_960/Auto%2FFilm-tour-Munich-adhd.jpg 1200w,https://res.cloudinary.com/norrona/image/upload/f_auto,d_imgmissing.jpg,fl_progressive.lossy,q_auto,b_rgb:fcfcfc,w_1400,h_1120/Auto%2FFilm-tour-Munich-adhd.jpg 1400w,https://res.cloudinary.com/norrona/image/upload/f_auto,d_imgmissing.jpg,fl_progressive.lossy,q_auto,b_rgb:fcfcfc,w_1600,h_1280/Auto%2FFilm-tour-Munich-adhd.jpg 1600w,https://res.cloudinary.com/norrona/image/upload/f_auto,d_imgmissing.jpg,fl_progressive.lossy,q_auto,b_rgb:fcfcfc,w_1800,h_1440/Auto%2FFilm-tour-Munich-adhd.jpg 1800w,https://res.cloudinary.com/norrona/image/upload/f_auto,d_imgmissing.jpg,fl_progressive.lossy,q_auto,b_rgb:fcfcfc,w_2200,h_1760/Auto%2FFilm-tour-Munich-adhd.jpg 2200w,https://res.cloudinary.com/norrona/image/upload/f_auto,d_imgmissing.jpg,fl_progressive.lossy,q_auto,b_rgb:fcfcfc,w_2600,h_2080/Auto%2FFilm-tour-Munich-adhd.jpg 2600w,https://res.cloudinary.com/norrona/image/upload/f_auto,d_imgmissing.jpg,fl_progressive.lossy,q_auto,b_rgb:fcfcfc,w_3200,h_2560/Auto%2FFilm-tour-Munich-adhd.jpg 3200w,https://res.cloudinary.com/norrona/image/upload/f_auto,d_imgmissing.jpg,fl_progressive.lossy,q_auto,b_rgb:fcfcfc,w_3840,h_3072/Auto%2FFilm-tour-Munich-adhd.jpg 3840w\" sizes=\"100vw\" width=\"4930\" height=\"3944\" alt=\"Presenters in Norrøna clothing stand by a screen showing &#39;ADHD&#39; before a seated audience in a dark venue.\" style=\"aspect-ratio:var(--media-ratio, 1.25);\" decoding=\"async\"></picture><!----></figure></div><!----></div><div class=\"m-t-18\"><!----></div></figure></div></div></section><section class=\"snippet-note\" data-sanity=\"id=e3dbd002-8f61-525f-a433-242787ad7459;type=eventPage;path=portableText:en.value:6e0ff3ee1dc5;base=%2F\"><span class=\"snippet-note-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 16\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" name=\"Food\" active=\"false\" outline=\"false\" keep-color=\"true\" fill=\"transparent\" stroke=\"false\" small=\"false\"><g fill=\"#1D1D1D\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"><path class=\"svgfill\" d=\"M2.5 1h1v4.25h1V1h1v4.25h1V1h1v5Q7.5 7.5 5.75 7.85V15h-1.5V7.85Q2.5 7.5 2.5 6V1Z\"></path><path class=\"svgfill\" d=\"M11 1c2 .5 2.5 3 2.5 6v2h-1.25v6h-1.5V1.6q0-.6.25-.6Z\"></path></g></svg></span><div class=\"snippet-note-content\"><p class=\"snippet-note-title -strong\">Food and drinks at Naturen</p><div><!--[--><p class=\"snippet-note-text\">Hungry? Come early and have pizza and drinks at our restaurant <em>Naturen</em> before the event starts. Book a table online, or call ahead to pre-order your pizza.</p><!--]--></div><!----><div class=\"snippet-note-links d-flex flex-wrap\"><!--[--><a href=\"tel:+47 474 96 866\" class=\"snippet-note-link\"><span>Call +47 474 96 866</span><svg width=\"16px\" height=\"16px\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" class=\"chevron\" style=\"width:14px;min-width:14px;height:14px;\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><g id=\"icons/arrow/small/right-light\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"><polygon id=\"bg\" points=\"0 0 16 0 16 16 0 16\"></polygon><polygon id=\"icon\" fill=\"#1D1D1D\" points=\"10 3.9995 8.939 5.0615 11.129 7.2495 2 7.2495 2 8.7505 11.129 8.7505 8.939 10.9385 10 11.9995 14 7.9995\"></polygon></g></svg></a><a href=\"mailto:naturen@norrona.no\" class=\"snippet-note-link\"><span>naturen@norrona.no</span><svg width=\"16px\" height=\"16px\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" class=\"chevron\" style=\"width:14px;min-width:14px;height:14px;\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><g id=\"icons/arrow/small/right-light\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"><polygon id=\"bg\" points=\"0 0 16 0 16 16 0 16\"></polygon><polygon id=\"icon\" fill=\"#1D1D1D\" points=\"10 3.9995 8.939 5.0615 11.129 7.2495 2 7.2495 2 8.7505 11.129 8.7505 8.939 10.9385 10 11.9995 14 7.99